        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG400-630  Contemporary Round Stainless Steel  Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very contemporary designed door pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish for a truly eye catching design. It has optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. Packaged standard with thru-bolt mounting (bolts through the door). Optional back to back mounting available (pulls bolt to each other).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-acb-710.jpg?v=1704354707\" width=\"224\" height=\"349\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG400 Contemporary Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-stainless-steel-leverset-ahi-sig152\"><b>Contemporary Door Levers</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG400 Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 350 mm (13.78\")</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Mounting Centers: 350 mm (13.78\") C/C</li> -->\r\n<li>Projection: 69 mm (2.72\")</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 35 mm (1.38\") Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Choice:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolt Mounting</b> - bolts through the door (1 pull)</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back mounting</b> - pulls bolt to each other through the door (requires two pulls)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle)</i>\r\n</p>",
