                "description": "AHI SIGMA 400 Door Pull - This very contemporary designed door pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish for a truly eye catching design. Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional  Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).",
